"<menuchoice><guimenu>Selecionar</guimenu><guimenuitem>Para "
"vetor</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/select/from-path.xml:38(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "In addition, you can click on the <guibutton>Path to Selection</guibutton> "
#| "button <placeholder-1/> in the Path dialog to access the command."
msgid ""
"In addition, you can click on the <guibutton>Path to Selection</guibutton> "
"button <placeholder-1/> in the Paths dialog to access the command."
msgstr ""
"Além disso, você pode clicar no botão <guibutton>Vetor para "
"seleção</guibutton> <placeholder-1/> na caixa de diálogo Vetores para "
"acessar o comando."

